<title>UK: Spring Ram plans disposal to Silentnight.</title>
<headline>Spring Ram plans disposal to Silentnight.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British kitchens and bathrooms manufacturer Spring Ram Corporation Plc said it was in talks to sell its Meredew Cabinet business to Silentnight Holdings Plc for a price of about 5.0 million stg.</p>
<p>In a brief statement, Spring Ram said completion of the transaction was expected before the end of December and it planned to make a further detailed announcement &quot;at the appropriate time&quot;.</p>
<p>Silentnight specialises in beds and assembled cabinet furniture.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
